WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.107 --> 00:00:14.708
&gt;&gt;&gt; President Biden set to speak

00:00:14.841 --> 00:00:15.642
there in just a few moments from

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:16.176
now at the royal castle here in

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:16.643
Warsaw, Poland.

00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:17.978
It's the same place he gave that

00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:19.112
impassioned plea last year

00:00:19.246 --> 00:00:24.184
shortly after Russia invaded

00:00:24.317 --> 00:00:24.518
Ukraine.

00:00:24.651 --> 00:00:28.922
&gt;&gt; Ukraine will never be a

00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:29.856
victory for Russia for these

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.291
people refuse to live in a world

00:00:31.658 --> 00:00:33.160
of hopelessness and darkness.

00:00:33.293 --> 00:00:34.494
We will have a different future,

00:00:34.628 --> 00:00:38.098
a brighter future, rooted in DEM

00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:39.166
Tracy and principle, hope and

00:00:39.299 --> 00:00:42.502
light, decency, dignity, freedom

00:00:42.636 --> 00:00:43.170
and possibilities.

00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:47.274
&gt;&gt; Joining us now is the mayor

00:00:47.674 --> 00:00:48.808
of Warsaw who is -- what a

00:00:48.942 --> 00:00:50.010
moment you've been living

00:00:50.143 --> 00:00:50.343
through.

00:00:50.477 --> 00:00:52.512
You are the mayor of Warsaw,

00:00:52.646 --> 00:00:54.214
you've now had a presidential

00:00:54.347 --> 00:00:55.148
visit from the U.S. Twice in

00:00:55.282 --> 00:00:56.483
less than a year.

00:00:56.616 --> 00:00:58.518
He didn't go to Berlin, didn't

00:00:58.652 --> 00:01:00.220
go to London, didn't go to

00:01:00.353 --> 00:01:00.520
Paris.

00:01:00.654 --> 00:01:01.821
What does it mean that he's here

00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:03.690
in Warsaw to give this speech?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.692
&gt;&gt; It's incredible, of course,

00:01:05.692 --> 00:01:07.227
the times are very difficult but

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:07.928
it's important that the

00:01:08.061 --> 00:01:08.662
president of the United States

00:01:08.795 --> 00:01:09.696
is in Poland again because it

00:01:09.729 --> 00:01:10.864
means that we are safe because

00:01:10.997 --> 00:01:12.866
with him he brings those

00:01:12.999 --> 00:01:14.100
guarantees of security.

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:15.869
And, of course, it is immensely

00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:18.705
important for us that he was in

00:01:18.838 --> 00:01:19.706
Kyiv, that he showed so much

00:01:19.706 --> 00:01:20.240
courage and that the united

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:21.708
States of America is ready to

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:21.841
help.

00:01:21.975 --> 00:01:23.376
&gt;&gt; And we heard from president

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:24.477
Putin this morning giving that

00:01:24.611 --> 00:01:25.245
lengthy speech.

00:01:25.378 --> 00:01:26.646
Overall it seemed to signal that

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.814
he doesn't believe this war in

00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:29.716
Ukraine is anywhere close to

00:01:29.716 --> 00:01:30.250
being over.

00:01:30.383 --> 00:01:31.952
What was your take away?

00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:33.086
&gt;&gt; Well, unfortunately it seems

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.788
that Putin wants to escalate,

00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:36.790
that he doesn't have a plan B.

00:01:36.923 --> 00:01:39.726
He miscalculated on so many

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:40.193
different fronts.

00:01:40.327 --> 00:01:41.728
He thought that Ukrainians will

00:01:41.728 --> 00:01:43.129
not defend their country, he

00:01:43.263 --> 00:01:44.698
thought that we could be divided

00:01:44.831 --> 00:01:46.433
and he just was wrong on both of

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:46.967
these counts.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.501
&gt;&gt; One thing has been about what

00:01:48.635 --> 00:01:49.836
the west is sending to Ukraine,

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.404
that was a major theme of his

00:01:51.738 --> 00:01:53.106
speech today, one point has been

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.074
the F-16s.

00:01:54.207 --> 00:01:55.308
The U.S. Is saying they are not

00:01:55.742 --> 00:01:56.843
going to train Ukrainian fighter

00:01:56.977 --> 00:01:59.746
pilots on the f-16,yet.

00:01:59.746 --> 00:02:00.647
Do you think that's a mistake?

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.015
Do you think they should do so

00:02:02.148 --> 00:02:03.750
in case they decide to send

00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:04.184
them?

00:02:04.317 --> 00:02:06.019
&gt;&gt; It's complicated but the most

00:02:06.152 --> 00:02:07.754
important thing is every taboo

00:02:07.754 --> 00:02:08.388
has been broken.

00:02:08.521 --> 00:02:09.322
I remember these conversations a

00:02:09.756 --> 00:02:10.824
year ago, many people were

00:02:10.957 --> 00:02:12.125
saying we shouldn't be sending

00:02:12.259 --> 00:02:13.793
heavy weapons, we shouldn't be

00:02:13.927 --> 00:02:16.096
tending tanks and it turned out

00:02:16.229 --> 00:02:18.498
that America and other European

00:02:18.632 --> 00:02:20.500
allies decided to actually help

00:02:20.634 --> 00:02:21.768
Ukraine because Ukrainians are

00:02:21.768 --> 00:02:23.770
fighting for our security so we

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:25.071
need to help them as much as we

00:02:25.205 --> 00:02:25.372
can.

00:02:25.772 --> 00:02:27.240
&gt;&gt; When you say our security,

00:02:27.374 --> 00:02:29.109
this war is on your doorstep.

00:02:29.242 --> 00:02:30.143
What does that feel like?

00:02:30.277 --> 00:02:33.413
&gt;&gt; Well, I mean, Poland is safe,

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.048
I mean, you see Warsaw just

00:02:35.181 --> 00:02:36.883
behind me, nothing changes.

00:02:37.017 --> 00:02:38.018
Of course, today everything is

00:02:38.151 --> 00:02:38.918
blocked because of the

00:02:39.052 --> 00:02:39.853
presidential visit, but life

00:02:39.986 --> 00:02:40.487
goes on.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.022
Thanks to president Biden and

00:02:42.155 --> 00:02:43.189
the American administration we

00:02:43.323 --> 00:02:44.557
feel safe, thanks to ourselves

00:02:44.691 --> 00:02:46.293
as well, but thanks to the

00:02:46.426 --> 00:02:47.193
Ukrainians who are fighting for

00:02:47.327 --> 00:02:48.495
the stability of the

00:02:48.628 --> 00:02:49.796
transatlantic alliance, fighting

00:02:49.796 --> 00:02:50.463
for our values.

00:02:50.597 --> 00:02:52.399
I mean, we talk about democracy,

00:02:52.532 --> 00:02:54.334
the rule of law all the time.

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:56.036
These guys are actually giving

00:02:56.169 --> 00:02:57.370
their lives for those values.

00:02:57.804 --> 00:02:58.405
&gt;&gt; What you seem to be saying is

00:02:58.538 --> 00:03:01.074
that instead of debating over

00:03:01.207 --> 00:03:02.809
sending certain weaponry, longer

00:03:02.942 --> 00:03:03.877
range missiles, planes to

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.111
Ukraine they should go ahead and

00:03:05.245 --> 00:03:05.812
send it?

00:03:05.945 --> 00:03:07.314
&gt;&gt; We should be helping Ukraine

00:03:07.447 --> 00:03:08.915
as much as we can.

00:03:09.049 --> 00:03:10.317
Of course the Americans are

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.419
doing it, pols are doing it, but

00:03:12.552 --> 00:03:15.388
many of our friends in western

00:03:15.822 --> 00:03:16.089
Europe were dragging our feet.

00:03:16.222 --> 00:03:17.824
We better keep the pressure up.

00:03:17.957 --> 00:03:20.560
We need to help those guys N

00:03:20.694 --> 00:03:22.629
Warsaw we are helping refugees

00:03:22.762 --> 00:03:24.097
and women and children.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.032
Many Ukrainians tell us we can

00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:29.135
fight because you are doing your

00:03:29.269 --> 00:03:29.436
best.

00:03:29.836 --> 00:03:31.838
You are informing, we're helping

00:03:31.838 --> 00:03:32.739
refugees, other people are

00:03:32.872 --> 00:03:34.107
sending weapons because we all

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.842
have a dog in this fight because

00:03:35.842 --> 00:03:37.410
every dictator, every crazy

00:03:37.844 --> 00:03:38.345
dictator in the world is

00:03:38.478 --> 00:03:39.346
watching, whether the west can

00:03:39.479 --> 00:03:41.081
be united, whether we can be

00:03:41.214 --> 00:03:42.282
strong and whether we can

00:03:42.415 --> 00:03:42.649
deliver.

00:03:42.782 --> 00:03:44.284
&gt;&gt; We are a year into this war

00:03:44.417 --> 00:03:46.519
and Poland saw the most refugees

00:03:46.653 --> 00:03:48.254
out of anyone, a lot of them

00:03:48.388 --> 00:03:49.856
came through Poland, went to

00:03:49.989 --> 00:03:51.324
other places but many still live

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:52.926
here, over a million in Poland,

00:03:53.059 --> 00:03:54.227
hundreds of thousands still live

00:03:54.361 --> 00:03:55.528
in your city.

00:03:55.862 --> 00:03:56.930
What is the impact of that a

00:03:57.063 --> 00:03:58.598
year in?

00:03:58.732 --> 00:04:00.333
&gt;&gt; It has been really amazing

00:04:00.467 --> 00:04:01.868
this show of solidarity.

00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.237
You don't see any people on the

00:04:04.371 --> 00:04:05.004
street, you don't see any camps

00:04:05.138 --> 00:04:05.872
for refugees because they are

00:04:06.005 --> 00:04:07.874
with us, with friends, with

00:04:07.874 --> 00:04:09.209
family, so on and so forth.

00:04:09.342 --> 00:04:10.543
I'm absolutely certain that we

00:04:10.677 --> 00:04:12.212
will get enriched by all of

00:04:12.345 --> 00:04:12.512
that.

00:04:12.645 --> 00:04:15.415
There is a silver lining on that

00:04:15.548 --> 00:04:16.783
cloud because Warsaw was one of

00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:18.418
the most diverse cities in

00:04:18.551 --> 00:04:19.986
between the wars and of course

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.888
after the second World War it

00:04:21.888 --> 00:04:22.455
was changed.

00:04:22.589 --> 00:04:24.624
Now we welcome these Ukrainians

00:04:24.758 --> 00:04:26.192
here for a while, maybe for

00:04:26.326 --> 00:04:28.194
longer, and we feel enriched.

00:04:28.328 --> 00:04:32.832
&gt;&gt; One thing we've seen Polish

00:04:32.966 --> 00:04:35.468
president Duda call for, is a

00:04:35.902 --> 00:04:37.036
bigger American presence a more

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.238
permanent presence here.

00:04:38.371 --> 00:04:39.472
Are there indications you think

00:04:39.906 --> 00:04:40.974
that is actually going to

00:04:41.107 --> 00:04:41.307
happen?

00:04:41.441 --> 00:04:43.910
&gt;&gt; We hope so, there is American

00:04:44.043 --> 00:04:45.545
presence on the ground and of

00:04:45.912 --> 00:04:46.813
course president Biden said

00:04:46.946 --> 00:04:48.314
every inch of nato territory

00:04:48.448 --> 00:04:49.516
will be defended.

00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:51.584
It first of all makes us feel

00:04:51.918 --> 00:04:52.886
more secure but also sends a

00:04:53.019 --> 00:04:54.621
very strong signal to the

00:04:54.754 --> 00:04:55.488
Russians that they shouldn't

00:04:55.922 --> 00:04:56.956
move any further and that, by

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:58.324
the way, they should start

00:04:58.458 --> 00:05:00.093
moving out of Ukraine because

00:05:00.226 --> 00:05:02.662
the west will be together, will

00:05:02.796 --> 00:05:04.464
be strong, next batch of

00:05:04.597 --> 00:05:05.565
sanctions are being prepared.

00:05:05.932 --> 00:05:06.800
So that's exactly the signal

00:05:06.933 --> 00:05:08.234
that we should be sending and

00:05:08.368 --> 00:05:10.370
those are the words that I'm

00:05:10.503 --> 00:05:11.504
waiting for that president Biden

00:05:11.938 --> 00:05:13.306
will deliver in a few hours.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.274
&gt;&gt; How long do you think it

00:05:14.407 --> 00:05:15.208
could go on for?

00:05:15.341 --> 00:05:16.543
&gt;&gt; It's very, very difficult to

00:05:16.676 --> 00:05:17.944
say, but that's why we need to

00:05:18.011 --> 00:05:19.312
help the Ukrainians because they

00:05:19.446 --> 00:05:21.314
are bleeding every day and, as

00:05:21.448 --> 00:05:22.515
I've said, you know, this is

00:05:22.649 --> 00:05:24.117
also our war.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.952
Some people think this is a war

00:05:25.952 --> 00:05:26.686
somewhere in the east, but this

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.123
is a war for our values, for the

00:05:30.256 --> 00:05:30.857
stability of our institutions,

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:31.357
for our community.

00:05:31.491 --> 00:05:33.960
As I've said, everyone is

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.161
watching, whether we can

00:05:35.295 --> 00:05:36.162
deliver, whether we can be

00:05:36.296 --> 00:05:36.529
strong.

00:05:36.663 --> 00:05:37.964
People thought the west will

00:05:37.997 --> 00:05:39.399
keep on deliberating and so on

00:05:39.532 --> 00:05:40.133
and so forth.

00:05:40.266 --> 00:05:41.968
We showed that we can do it

00:05:41.968 --> 00:05:42.802
together and we should simply

00:05:42.936 --> 00:05:43.970
continue doing it.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.972
&gt;&gt; Mayor, thank you so much for

00:05:45.972 --> 00:05:46.206
joining us here.

00:05:46.339 --> 00:05:48.741
Thank you for hosting us in your

00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:49.042
city.

00:05:49.175 --> 00:05:49.576
&gt;&gt; Pleasure.

00:05:49.976 --> 00:05:50.210
Come to Warsaw.

